use ICMP protocol

IP fielsd adress of sender and of reciever 
    aka my adress and the adress of the ohter guy i want response from


ICMP fields
    type 8 for echo when you are sending first 
    type 0 when you are sentind back
    checksum to validate the message
        decifer this later 
        The checksum is the 16-bit ones's complement of the one's
        complement sum of the ICMP message starting with the ICMP Type.
        For computing the checksum , the checksum field should be zero.
        If the total length is odd, the received data is padded with one
        octet of zeros for computing the checksum.  This checksum may be
        replaced in the future.
        i think just plus all the bits before

    identifier if code == 0 so if i recieve the message you get number to match the pings

    data recieved in echo will be the same in the response message




